WEBVTT

00:06:57.395 --> 00:07:00.922
because hopefully the next time
your heart is pounding from stress,

00:07:00.946 --> 00:07:02.769
you're going to remember this talk

00:07:02.793 --> 00:07:04.931
and you're going to think to yourself,

00:07:04.955 --> 00:07:09.520
this is my body helping me
rise to this challenge.

00:07:10.129 --> 00:07:12.444
And when you view stress in that way,

00:07:12.468 --> 00:07:14.501
your body believes you,

00:07:14.525 --> 00:07:17.008
and your stress response
becomes healthier.

00:07:18.204 --> 00:07:22.356
Now I said I have over a decade
of demonizing stress

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.330
to redeem myself from,

00:07:24.354 --> 00:07:26.940
so we are going to do
one more intervention.

00:07:26.964 --> 00:07:28.068
I want to tell you

00:07:28.092 --> 00:07:31.963
about one of the most under-appreciated
aspects of the stress response,